cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Text Watermark Round-Trip: does a full paraphrase remove SynthID Text?"
message: "If you use this code or these artifacts, please cite the repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Balakhonov
    given-names: Kirill
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/krllagent/text-watermark-roundtrip"
url: "https://painintheagent.com"
date-released: 2026-08-22
abstract: >
  Reproducible measurement of how synonym edits, German and Chinese
  round-trip translation, a full model paraphrase and the DIPPER paraphraser
  affect the reference SynthID Text watermark on a ten-document corpus, with a
  blinded four-vendor fact panel judging meaning preservation.
